 "Aqua (Water), Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Glycerin, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1 (and) Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7, Niacinamide, Benzoic Acid (and) Dehydroacetic Acid (and) Benzyl Alcohol, Panthenol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Allantoin, Cannabis Sativa Callus Lysate, Disodium EDTA.": "Aqua (Water), Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Glycerin, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1 (and) Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7, Niacinamide, Benzoic Acid (and) Dehydroacetic Acid (and) Benzyl Alcohol, Panthenol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Allantoin, Cannabis Sativa Callus Lysate, Disodium EDTA.",
